    HumidityRatioDifference,    !- Zone Latent Heating Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Input Method
    ,                         !- Zone Humidification Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio
    0.005;                    !- Zone Humidification Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Difference

OUTPUT:VARIABLE,
    *,                        !- Key Value
    Zone Ideal Loads Zone Total Heating Energy,    !- Variable Name
    Hourly;                   !- Reporting Frequency

OUTPUT:SQLITE,
    SimpleAndTabular,         !- Option Type
    UseOutputControlTableStyle;    !- Unit Conversion for Tabular Data